description.narrative:
The purpose or intended use of the evaluation is to identify possible implementation impediments, offering adjustment recommendations for programme intervention for the next support phase, as well as consideration for the project exit strategy or next round of support.

The main objective under the current assignment will be: 
1)	analyze the overall implementation status of the Docudays’ strategy components is-à-vis the initiative’s goals and objectives (RAF);
2)	identify current impediments (bottlenecks) in implementing the programme in line with the approved work plan, and propose, when/where necessary and feasible the most appropriate and relevant response/mitigation strategy;
3)	assess the relevance of the programme and how it responds to the overall country context and reforms/developmental and suggest mid-, and long-term direction for the initiative.
